          "start": 0
        },
        "quote": "(a) Defacement or Damage of Property by Graffiti. It shall be unlawful for any person to write, spray, scratch or otherwise affix graffiti upon any property, public or private, in which another has an interest and without the consent of such other person. A person found in violation of this section shall be punished by a fine not to exceed $499.00, or by imprisonment for not more than 179 days, or by both such fine and imprisonment. In addition to such penalty the court shall order the convicted person to perform the necessary labor to clean up, repair or replace the property damaged by that person, or to pay any costs incurred by the owner or the City related to the cleanup, repair or replacement of property damaged by that person.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.30.010:block:0#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
